<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts IDEXX.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman starts IDEXX.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Angus Macdonald initiated coverage of IDEXX Laboratories Corp with a buy rating, putting a 12-month price target on the stock of $46.</p>
<p>-- &quot;This very dynamic company has enjoyed rapid growth exploiting the heretofore sleepy market in veterinary diagnostics,&quot; a Lehman report said.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-1/2 to 35 in early trading.</p>
</text>
